  "notes": "Ministry of Education public schools; cycles of four grades each since 2018-19 (six before). The English u.ae page says Cycle 2 is Grades 6 to 8, an evident typo: the same page says each cycle has four grades and the Arabic page gives الخامس حتى الثامن (5 to 8). From Grade 9 students follow General, Advanced, Elite or Applied streams. Many private schools follow British, American, Indian or other curricula with their own year names; this file covers the national system."
